TIP:  For the intro and instrumental bridge pick out the 3 individual notes and then the chords.  (Notes may or may not transpose).  Untransposed form (C) but lift off on your middle finger and position it above the 3rd string instead of the 4th.  Now pick the open 3rd string (g), put your finger down on the 3rd string and pick the same 3rd string.  That's (a).  Now pick the 2nd string which is coverd by your index finger (c) while at the same time moving your middle finger back to it's usual position on the 4th string, and strum (C) and finish the rest of the chords.  If you don't want to be bothered with the notes, play 3 extra (C).
  
 
